{"seq":13,"slug":"workflow-engine-orchestration","title":"工作流引擎与业务编排","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration","rating":{"composite":4.43,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 工作流引擎与业务编排 简介\n\n工作流引擎解决的是一种特殊的可靠性问题：一个业务过程跨越多个服务、持续数小时甚至数月时，任何进程都可能在步骤之间消失，但业务意图不能随之丢失。\n\n本 hub 聚焦持久工作流的架构与运行时，不把引擎描述成“自动获得精确一次副作用”的魔法。引擎能够持久保存控制状态、定时器与已确认结果；真正的外部写入仍可能因确认丢失而重复执行，必须由 Activity、目标服务和幂等账本共同收口。\n\n本 hub 与同分类的兄弟主题有清晰边界。分布式事务主题解释一致性模型与协议，幂等重试主题解释单次操作的投递语义，本 hub 则讨论如何把这些能力组合成可长期运行、可演进、可运维的业务流程。\n\n内容按四章推进。\n\n第一章建立控制流词汇，比较中心编排与事件协同，并用状态机、DAG 和代码即流程表达业务约束。\n\n第二章进入运行时，解释 Workflow、Activity、Task、Worker、事件历史与确定性重放各自负责什么，并比较 Temporal、AWS、Azure、Google Cloud 与 Restate 的不同取舍。\n\n第三章处理最容易在生产中出错的变化：补偿并不等于回滚，人工决策需要鉴权和去重，部署新代码必须保护仍在运行的旧实例。\n\n第四章把系统放入生产环境，覆盖队列背压、容量规划、安全隔离、可观测性、服务级目标、重放测试与故障演练。\n\n推荐先读第一章，再完整阅读第二章。准备选型的读者随后阅读第三章的版本迁移和第四章的性能扩展；准备上线的团队应把第三、四章作为一个连续的发布检查单。\n\n阅读前需要理解微服务调用、消息队列、超时与重试、最终一致性，并能区分业务状态与基础设施状态。无需预先使用过某个工作流产品。\n\n读完后，你应能画出控制面与副作用面的所有权边界，解释一次 Activity 超时为何可能意味着“效果已发生但回执未知”，选择适合流程寿命的版本策略，并用可验证的指标与故障演练证明系统能够恢复。\n\n截至 2026 年 8 月，文中的时效性能力以各产品官方文档为准；具体 SDK 名称和默认值在落地时仍需绑定到所用版本验证。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"工作流基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workflow-patterns-overview","title":"工作流模式概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/foundations/workflow-patterns-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"orchestration-vs-choreography","title":"编排与协同的架构选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/foundations/orchestration-vs-choreography"},{"seq":3,"slug":"workflow-modeling","title":"工作流建模方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/foundations/workflow-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"engines","title":"工作流引擎与持久执行","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/engines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"temporal-cadence","title":"Temporal 与 Cadence 持久执行平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/engines/temporal-cadence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"step-functions-durable","title":"云原生编排服务：Step Functions 与 Durable Functions","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/engines/step-functions-durable"},{"seq":3,"slug":"engine-internals","title":"工作流引擎内核原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/engines/engine-internals"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"可靠编排模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"saga-compensation","title":"Saga 补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/saga-compensation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"human-in-the-loop","title":"人工审批环节的建模与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/human-in-the-loop"},{"seq":3,"slug":"versioning-migration","title":"工作流版本化与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/versioning-migration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production","title":"工作流生产工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-debugging","title":"工作流可观测性与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/production/observability-debugging"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-strategies","title":"工作流测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/production/testing-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-scaling","title":"工作流引擎性能与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/production/performance-scaling"}]}]}